#: ../../source/docs/common-reach-rtk-receiver.rst:37
#: 190a261c5106434fbccf9d3e57123179
msgid ""
"A Reach unit mounted on the vehicle can receive base corrections over "
"telemetry radio, thus not requiring a separate correction link to the drone."
" Coordinate output is implemented via a serial port."
msgstr "安装在飞行器上的 Reach 设备可通过数传电台接收基站差分数据，因此无需为无人机单独配备差分数据链路。坐标输出通过串口实现。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-reach-rtk-receiver.rst:42
#: 3018603ff4b84a48b9558ba26cf5c7b4
msgid ""
"For more information on Reach and Pixhawk integration, visit `Reach "
"ArduPilot integration docs <https://docs.emlid.com/reach/ardupilot-"
"integration/>`__."
msgstr ""
"有关 Reach 与 Pixhawk 集成的更多信息，请访问 `Reach ArduPilot 集成文档 "
"<https://docs.emlid.com/reach/ardupilot-integration/>`__。"

